# This repository is cloned into /var/ossec/etc on the Wazuh manager, next to
# secrets such as client.keys, authd.pass and sslmanager.key. It is therefore an
# ALLOW-LIST: everything is ignored unless it is listed below, so `git add .` on
# the SIEM can never stage a secret or a config file by accident.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/check_rule_ids.py
!/branch_rules/
!/deploy/

# Rulesets: only top-level XML files.
!/rules/
/rules/*
!/rules/*.xml
!/decoders/
/decoders/*
!/decoders/*.xml

# Never track key material or editor leftovers, even inside allowed folders.
*.key
*.pem
*.pass
*.swp
*~
*.bak
*.orig
